  "semantic_review": {
    "installation": "Manifest/lock provisioning is described correctly, global-package copying claim is removed, runtime extras are distinguished from dependency groups, incompatible ssl/llm_eval selection is described and independently rejected. All 13 fenced evaluator commands retain --locked and --extra llm_eval. Existing nltk==3.10.3 override and xxhash>=3.8.1,<4 constraint remain exactly the source contract; no new security claim or scope is introduced.",
    "resources": "Explicit provision command names punkt and punkt_tab; actual fresh owned data resolves tokenizers/punkt and tokenizers/punkt_tab. Missing-resource preflight returned usage error before optional runtime-module import. Resource provisioning before offline use is correctly stated.",
    "model_and_cache": "Current save_pretrained model/tokenizer export has priority; fallback copies each distinct resolved existing local source completely with independent files; configured source artifacts remain unchanged. Full copy/disk/time cost, ordinary Hugging Face cache exclusion, temporary model/output/response-cache cleanup, per-evaluation freshness and stable-source/concurrent-writer limits match the accepted implementation and the independent actual11 execution.",
    "profile": "Strict llm-eval inventory/outcome requirements, no collection/runtime equivalence, rejection of selection/exclusion filters, explicit filesystem focused invocation, focused prerequisite/outcome checks, optional pyargs/cross-profile restrictions and pre-import exclusion for ordinary core/base/mandatory/mlx-native scopes match d2ed4bcbc46684ac60dfdb1505ff764029ee48e9. The optional and combined collection logs each contain exactly the 11 ledger nodeids with no native cases.",
    "workload_and_claim_boundaries": "Supplied SmolLM2 config really selects cuda:0 and external artifacts; CPU guidance correctly requires both evaluation.device=cpu and trainer --cpu. Controlled tiny local GPT-2/parquet/one-token CPU regression fixtures preserve upstream prompt/metric rules and demonstrate integration behavior; docs expressly exclude public benchmark accuracy, downloaded model quality, performance, GPU and distributed qualification.",
    "combined_dependencies": "test-model-search includes test and ptflops in the actual manifest. Documented combined uv invocation collected 1646 tests with the exact optional11 inventory and native scope excluded. Combined runtime execution is not claimed by this docs review."
  },
